# Exam track — Theme: Hobbien & Fräizäit — Sub-lesson 3: Talking About It
# @question sentences: the examiner asks in Luxembourgish, the learner
# assembles the Luxembourgish answer (always en→lu).
#
# These are the user's real answers, gathered by interview on 2026-08-21/22 —
# do not "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass. The point is
# that the learner rehearses what they will actually say in the Sproochentest.
#
# The three @fill blocks carry frames that recur across any topic: a
# well-causal reason, a wann-conditional, and a comparative with "léiwer wéi".

@lesson H1.03 "Talking About Hobbies"

@word de Canapé = the couch
@word d'Tëlee = the TV
@word sech leeën = to lie down
@word kucken = to watch
@word firwat = why
@word wéini = when
@word mat wiem = with whom
@word wéi vill = how much / how many
@word de Papp = the father
@word de Camping = the campsite
@word den Hond = the dog
@word den Apparat = the appliance
@word reparéieren = to repair
@word motivéieren = to motivate
@word mengen = to think, to believe
@word ophalen = to stop
@word plënneren = to move (house)
@word installéieren = to install
@word zesummebauen = to assemble
@word héieren = to hear
@word kafen = to buy

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir gär doheem?
@lu Ech leeë mech gär op de Canapé, an ech liese gär Bicher a kucke gär Tëlee.
@en I like to lie down on the couch, and I like reading books and watching TV.
@distractor-lu kafen
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-en buy
@distractor-en music

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir e kreativen Hobby?
@lu Jo, Fotoe maachen ass meng kreativ Aktivitéit.
@en Yes, taking photos is my creative activity.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en sport

@sentence
@question Säit wéini maacht Dir Fotoen?
@lu Ech maache Fotoe säit ech Kand sinn, well mäi Papp e Fotoapparat hat.
@en I've been taking photos since I was a child, because my father had a camera.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Wéini maacht Dir Fotoen?
@lu Ech maache Fotoen, wa mir reesen oder Vakanz hunn.
@en I take photos when we travel or when we're on vacation.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Beschreift Ären Hobby!
@lu Ech maache gär Fotoe vu Bierger, a bei kloer Nuecht probéieren ech Stären ze fotografeieren.
@en I like taking photos of mountains, and on clear nights I try to photograph stars.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir Ären Hobby gär?
@lu Ech fotografeiere gär, fir Erënnerungen ze maachen an déi schéinste Plaze mat anerer ze deelen.
@en I like taking photos, in order to make memories and share the most beautiful places with others.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Wéi een anere kreativen Hobby géif Iech interesséieren?
@lu Ech géif gär Diorama maachen, an dat si Miniature vun Dierfer.
@en I would like to make dioramas, and those are miniatures of villages.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en sport

@sentence
@question Wat fir Aktivitéiten maacht Dir gär am Summer dobaussen?
@lu Wann d'Wieder schéin ass, wanderen ech gär an d'Bierger.
@en When the weather is nice, I like hiking in the mountains.
@distractor-lu Concert
@distractor-lu Instrument
@distractor-en concert
@distractor-en instrument

@sentence
@question An zu Lëtzebuerg?
@lu Wann ech laang Vakanz hunn, fueren ech a Frankräich oder an d'Schwäiz, mee de Weekend fueren ech an d'Mëllerdall zu Lëtzebuerg.
@en If I have a long vacation, I go to France or Switzerland, but on the weekend I go to the Mëllerdall in Luxembourg.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Wat hutt Dir gär als Kand gemaach, a fir wéi laang?
@lu Als Kand hunn ech gär gedanzt, an ech war fir siwe Joer an enger Danzschoul, wou mir Tango, Walzer a Rumba gedanzt hunn.
@en As a child I liked dancing, and I was at a dance school for seven years, where we danced tango, waltz, and rumba.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en sport

@sentence
@question Firwat hutt Dir opgehal, an interesséiert Iech dat haut nach?
@lu Ech si geplënnert, an d'Danzschoul war ze wäit fort, mee ech sinn nach ëmmer e bësschen interesséiert.
@en I moved, and the dance school was too far away, but I'm still a little interested today.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Bicher liest Dir gär?
@lu Ech liese gär Science-Fiction, an ech hu virun kuerzem Colony vum Max Kidruk gelies.
@en I like reading science fiction, and I recently read Colony by Max Kidruk.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Fotoen
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en photos

@sentence
@question Wat gefält Iech u Bicher?
@lu Ech interesséiere mech fir de Weltraum, an d'Auteure weisen dacks d'Probleemer vun haut an der Zukunft.
@en I'm interested in space, and the authors often show today's problems in the future.
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-en books
@distractor-en music

@sentence
@question Lauschtert Dir Musek? Wéi eng Zort, a wéi oft gitt Dir op Concerten?
@lu Jo, ech lauschtere gär Rockmusek, an ech ginn op d'mannst véier oder fënnef Mol am Joer an d'Rockhal.
@en Yes, I like listening to rock music, and I go to the Rockhal at least four or five times a year.
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-en books
@distractor-en sport

@sentence
@question Op wéi ee Concert waart Dir fir d'lescht?
@lu Mir sinn zulescht op e Concert vun Offspring gaangen, an dat ass eng interessant Punkrock Band aus Amerika.
@en We most recently went to an Offspring concert, and that's an interesting punk rock band from America.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Wou war de Concert, a wéi huet e Iech gefall?
@lu De Concert war op der Plaz bei der Luxexpo a ganz spannend, mee mir sinn ze spéit komm, dofir hu mir net all Lidder gehéiert.
@en The concert was at the square near the Luxexpo and really exciting, but we arrived too late, so we didn't hear every song.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Spillt Dir en Instrument? Firwat net?
@lu Nee, ech spille kee Instrument, an ech hu mir eng Gittar kaf, mee ech hu keng Gedold fir ze üben.
@en No, I don't play an instrument, and I bought myself a guitar, but I don't have the patience to practice.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Concert
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en concert

@sentence
@question Wat sinn Är Pläng fir d'nächst Joer wat Är Fräizäit ugeet?
@lu Ech plangen, fir d'nächst Joer op Norwegen ze fueren, an engem Camping ze wunnen a mat mengem Hond ze wanderen.
@en I'm planning to go to Norway next year, live at a campsite, and hike with my dog.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Kënnt Dir doheem en Apparat oder eng Maschinn reparéieren?
@lu Mir hunn eng nei Wunneng, an ech muss vill doheem reparéieren, an ech muss Luuchten installéieren a Miwwelen zesummebauen.
@en We have a new apartment, and I have to repair a lot at home, and I have to install lights and assemble furniture.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en books

@sentence
@question Wéi kann ee Kanner motivéieren méi kreativ ze sinn?
@lu Ech mengen, Kanner ginn duerch d'Beispill vun den Eltere motivéiert.
@en I think children get motivated through the example set by their parents.
@distractor-lu Musek
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-en music
@distractor-en sport

